Source: ishtaria-admin
Section: games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Vitex Software <info@vitexsoftware.cz>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, g++, pkgconf | pkg-config, libtvision-dev, libncurses-dev | libncursesw5-dev, libpq-dev, gettext
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/VitexSoftware/ishtaria-admin
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/VitexSoftware/ishtaria-admin.git
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ishtaria-admin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: ishtaria-server, ishtaria-worldgen
Description: Text-mode administration of an Ishtaria world server
 Turbo Vision interface for the server operator. Save, load, rename, delete
 and export world maps, rename, ban and delete players, manage portals to
 linked worlds and schedule a server shutdown with a notice shown to players.
 .
 It works directly on the PostgreSQL database of ishtaria-server; run it as
 the service user (sudo -u ishtaria ishtaria-admin).
